{
  "uid": "bench-collector",
  "title": "Collector (SERVER 2)",
  "description": "What can actually be observed of the OTLP collector, and what cannot.",
  "tags": [
    "benchmark",
    "collector"
  ],
  "timezone": "utc",
  "editable": true,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
        "label": "Datasource",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {
          "text": "Prometheus",
          "value": "Prometheus"
        },
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Collector observability is limited by design of the build",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "The collector is constructed with a `SimpleMeterRegistry`. Its Micrometer meters \u2014 `export.records`, `export.latency`, `writer.data_phase_ms`, `writer.post_ingest_phase_ms`, `writer.pending_batches` \u2014 exist in process memory and are **never exported anywhere**.\n\nWhat is shown below is everything actually observable: the `/health` endpoint (status, uptime, queue count, `batchesProcessed`), what the generator sees from the client side, and the effect on the catalog. The single most useful diagnostic in the whole pipeline \u2014 `data_phase_ms` vs `post_ingest_phase_ms`, which answers *is the bottleneck DuckDB or the catalog?* \u2014 is not reachable. See `IMPROVEMENTS.md`."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Liveness",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Collector",
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "bench_collector_up",
          "legendFormat": "Collector",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": null,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "#6b7d8f",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "#4f8a6a",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNonNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
